<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>스마트 근무시간 & 연차 시뮬레이터</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/xlsx/0.18.5/xlsx.full.min.js"></script>
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        @import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard/dist/web/static/pretendard.css');
        body { font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 min-h-screen pb-20">

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="bg-indigo-600 text-white shadow-lg">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex justify-between items-center">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-briefcase text-2xl text-indigo-200"></i>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">근무시간 & 연차 시뮬레이터</h1>
                    <p class="text-xs text-indigo-200">선택근무제 (미래날짜 실적오류 수정 완제) v3.0</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-2">
                <button onclick="shareLink()" class="bg-indigo-500 hover:bg-indigo-400 text-white text-xs px-3 py-2 rounded-lg transition flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-share-nodes"></i> 공유하기
                </button>
                <button onclick="resetData()" class="bg-rose-500 hover:bg-rose-400 text-white text-xs px-3 py-2 rounded-lg transition flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-left"></i> 초기화
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 mt-6 space-y-6">

        <!-- Top Section: Excel Upload & Summary Dashboard -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            
            <!-- Excel Upload Box -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-2 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                        <h2 class="font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-file-excel text-emerald-600"></i> 근무현황 엑셀 불러오기
                        </h2>
                        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full">실시간 초과 적립시간 계산 지원</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-4">회사 인트라넷에서 다운로드한 <code class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">근무현황.xlsx</code> 파일을 업로드하시거나 아래에서 수기로 입력하세요.</p>
                    
                    <div id="dropZone" onclick="document.getElementById('fileInput').click()" 
                         class="border-2 border-dashed border-slate-300 hover:border-indigo-500 hover:bg-indigo-50/30 rounded-xl p-8 text-center cursor-pointer transition flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xl">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-up"></i>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700">클릭하거나 엑셀 파일(.xlsx)을 여기에 올려주세요</p>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">서버에 저장되지 않고 개인 브라우저에서만 안전하게 처리됩니다.</p>
                        <input type="file" id="fileInput" accept=".xlsx, .xls" class="hidden" onchange="handleFileSelect(event)">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div id="fileInfo" class="mt-4 hidden flex justify-between items-center text-xs bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 border border-emerald-200 p-3 rounded-lg">
                    <span class="font-medium flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-emerald-600"></i> <span id="fileName">근무현황.xlsx</span> 파일이 연동되었습니다.
                    </span>
                    <button onclick="clearExcelData()" class="text-rose-600 hover:underline font-bold">엑셀 연결 해제</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Summary Card with Month Switcher -->
            <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-8 opacity-10 text-9xl font-black pointer-events-none" id="bgMonthNum">9</div>
                
                <div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">대상 월 선택:</span>
                            <select id="monthSelect" onchange="changeMonth(this.value)" class="bg-slate-800 text-white font-bold text-sm border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:outline-none">
                                <option value="9">2026년 9월</option>
                                <option value="10">2026년 10월</option>
                                <option value="11">2026년 11월 (11/23 만료)</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <span id="statusBadge" class="bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-300 border border-indigo-500/30 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold">정산 중</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 my-3 border-y border-slate-800 py-3">
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">총 인정 근무시간</p>
                            <p class="text-lg font-bold text-indigo-400" id="totalWorked">0:00</p>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">오늘 기준 누계 초과/부족</p>
                            <p class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400" id="currentOvertime">+0:00 여유</p>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">월 목표시간 (소정)</p>
                            <p class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-200" id="targetWork">160:00</p>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">월 잔여 목표시간</p>
                            <p class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400" id="diffWork">160:00 필요</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
                    <div class="bg-slate-800/80 rounded-xl p-2.5 text-slate-300 flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb text-amber-400"></i> 남은 평일 추천 퇴근:</span>
                        <span class="font-bold text-white ml-1" id="recommendTime">계획 필요</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-800/80 rounded-xl p-2.5 text-slate-300 flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-flag-checkered text-rose-400"></i> 인턴 종료일:</span>
                        <span class="font-bold text-rose-300">2026년 11월 23일(월)</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Navigation Tabs -->
        <div class="flex border-b border-slate-200 bg-white rounded-xl px-2 pt-2 shadow-sm">
            <button id="tab1Btn" onclick="switchTab('tab1')" class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-sm border-b-2 border-indigo-600 text-indigo-600 transition flex items-center gap-2">
